  "description": "A zoo of classic Life patterns, each doing its textbook trick. Conway's Classic and six recoloured copies of it share the same rules, so every pattern behaves as it would in the original game while its colour tells you which is which. Glider Gun and Eater feeds a stream of gliders to an eater; Oscillator Garden is a quiet showcase of oscillators and still lifes.",
  "organisms": [
    {
      "schemaVersion": 1,
      "id": "conways-classic",
      "name": "Conway's Classic",
      "description": "The original Game of Life rules: a cell is born with exactly 3 neighbors of its own kind and survives with 2 or 3, otherwise it dies. It can only defend, never take a cell from another organism, so in a mixed dish watch invaders eat into its colonies.",
